530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[BlackRock raises its stake in Axis Bank to 5%]]> </title><description><![CDATA[BlackRock has successfully increased its stake in Axis Bank to 5 per cent by acquiring more shares from the open market. Specifically, the investment giant procured 18,560 crore additional shares, nudging its ownership from 4.99 per cent. This elevates BlackRock's total holding to 155,726,461 shares. Notably, during the second quarter ending September 2026, Axis Bank showcased impressive growth, with a substantial surge in both net and operating profits.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/blackrock-raises-its-stake-in-axis-bank-to-5/articleshow/135929469.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135929469,imgsize-35366.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/blackrock-raises-its-stake-in-axis-bank-to-5/articleshow/135929469.cms</guid><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 19:58:06 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Eternal among 5 stocks hitting 52-week highs; stock rallies up to 15% in a month]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Five BSE 100 stocks, including Eternal, DLF and Kotak Mahindra Bank, touched fresh 52-week highs on Tuesday. Eternal led monthly gains with a 15% rally.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/eternal-among-5-stocks-hitting-52-week-highs-stock-rallies-up-to-15-in-a-month/slideshow/135924700.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135924601,imgsize-30194.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/eternal-among-5-stocks-hitting-52-week-highs-stock-rallies-up-to-15-in-a-month/slideshow/135924700.cms</guid><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:27:16 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Sebi may limit leveraged stock bets to curb volatility: Report]]> </title><description><![CDATA[India's markets regulator is exploring potential limits on leveraged stock purchases amid increasing retail participation. Concerns have arisen as margin-funded stock bets have reached record levels in recent months. Discussions are ongoing regarding hard limits tied to a company's free float to manage risks effectively. While the regulator aims to mitigate market instability, it seeks to avoid disrupting retail investors' positions.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/sebi-may-limit-leveraged-stock-bets-to-curb-volatility-report/articleshow/135920460.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135920460,imgsize-56808.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/sebi-may-limit-leveraged-stock-bets-to-curb-volatility-report/articleshow/135920460.cms</guid><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 15:37:02 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[FIIs, MFs raise stakes in 5 largecap stocks for two straight quarters; shares rally up to 80%]]> </title><description><![CDATA[FIIs and mutual funds have increased their stakes in five largecap stocks for two consecutive quarters, signalling rising institutional interest. All five stocks have delivered positive returns in FY27 so far, with gains ranging from 12% to 80%.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/fiis-mfs-raise-stakes-in-5-largecap-stocks-for-two-straight-quarters-shares-rally-up-to-80/slideshow/135915639.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135915521,imgsize-24546.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/fiis-mfs-raise-stakes-in-5-largecap-stocks-for-two-straight-quarters-shares-rally-up-to-80/slideshow/135915639.cms</guid><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:54:18 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Tata Consumer Share Price Highlights: Tata Consumer Stock Price History]]> </title><description><![CDATA[]]> </description><